1
00:00:00,233 --> 00:00:01,200
This is a bale

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,633
of paddy straw.

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:03,567
A month ago,

4
00:00:03,567 --> 00:00:04,200
it was standing

5
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,800
in a field in Punjab.

6
00:00:05,933 --> 00:00:07,300
Here is where it goes next.

7
00:00:07,467 --> 00:00:08,533
After the harvest,

8
00:00:08,533 --> 00:00:10,567
a baler presses the loose

9
00:00:10,567 --> 00:00:12,467
straw into tight bales,

10
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:13,167
so it can be

11
00:00:13,167 --> 00:00:14,867
moved instead of burned.

12
00:00:15,067 --> 00:00:16,900
An aggregator collects bales

13
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:18,467
from dozens of farms

14
00:00:18,467 --> 00:00:20,933
and stacks them at a depot,

15
00:00:21,067 --> 00:00:22,367
dry and covered.

16
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:23,433
From there,

17
00:00:23,467 --> 00:00:24,400
a truck takes them

18
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:25,400
to a pellet plant.

19
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:27,233
The straw is shredded,

20
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:27,600
dried,

21
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,767
and pressed into small,

22
00:00:29,867 --> 00:00:30,733
dense pellets.

23
00:00:31,067 --> 00:00:32,633
The pellets are tested.

24
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:33,933
Heat value.

25
00:00:34,467 --> 00:00:35,200
Moisture.

26
00:00:35,267 --> 00:00:35,833
Ash.

27
00:00:36,067 --> 00:00:36,800
Then they are loaded

28
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:38,267
for a power plant that must

29
00:00:38,267 --> 00:00:40,500
burn biomass along with coal.

30
00:00:40,833 --> 00:00:41,933
One bale.

31
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,067
Five businesses.

32
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:44,033
Farmer,

33
00:00:44,067 --> 00:00:44,900
baler,

34
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:45,900
aggregator,

35
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:46,833
pellet maker,

36
00:00:47,067 --> 00:00:47,600
buyer.

37
00:00:48,233 --> 00:00:49,167
Every link has

38
00:00:49,167 --> 00:00:50,667
to find the next one.

39
00:00:50,667 --> 00:00:52,700
That is the chain IndiaBiomass

40
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:54,600
is being built to connect.
